From ea23635e3ee34f84a02ca7a4895d25b43783316b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:22:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] sidebar dot: say "status unknown", not "running",
 for unknown-only background work

The `background` dot claims a row whose only open work has unknown or unfresh
evidence (kanban_unknown, a stale remote count, an absent/expired observation,
an unknown execution observation). That claim is intentional: unknown must
never read as done. But the dot's aria-label/title was always
`sidebar.row.backgroundRunning` ("Background task running"), so a parked remote
card with state=unknown/missing_qualified_identity read as running. That is
fabricated certainty (Mac live readback D2, t_01a1c7a649c59bec).

Fix (claim and color unchanged; only the words):
- `backgroundDotUnknown(row, liveElsewhere)` in session-dot-state.ts: true when
  nothing positively runs (no process: renderer-polled or backend
  `background_active`; no async subagents; no goal; no current running/queued
  execution from `rowExecution`, i.e. the existing
  `summarizeExecutionObservations` counts) and the claim rests on unknown or
  unfresh evidence. Rows held only by known waiting/blocked work keep the old
  label.
- `useBackgroundDotUnknown` reads only stores the dot state already derives
  from ($backgroundRunningSessionIds, $delegatingSessionIds, the existing
  $kanbanObservationTick for time-only expiry). No new store or poll.
- `sessionDotVariant(state, outcome, backgroundUnknown)` swaps the background
  variant's aria/title to new key `sidebar.row.backgroundUnknown`
  ("Open work, current status unknown"), translated in ar, de, es, fr, ja,
  ru, zh, zh-hant; locales/_keys.desktop.json regenerated.

Proof (apps/desktop, vitest --pool=forks --maxWorkers=1):
- RED on origin/main with only the tests copied in: 5 failed
  (unknown-only row label, expired-evidence row label, 3 predicate tests);
  running-card / live-process control tests passed on main too.
- GREEN: session-row.test.tsx + session-dot-state.test.ts 150 passed;
  src/app/chat/sidebar + execution-observation-row + src/i18n 73 files /
  847 tests passed; every other suite importing the dot/state modules
  (10 files, 220 tests) passed.
- tsc -p . --noEmit clean; eslint clean on touched files.
- Mutants (each dropped condition): 10/11 killed. The survivor removes the
  hook's `state === 'background'` short-circuit, which is a perf guard only
  (the variant ignores the flag for any other state).
